            "review_title": "Review at Bo Gia Ice Cream - Coffee - Restaurant",
            "review_text": "punacoast\nPahoa, Hawaii645 contributions\n0\nLife is short, eat ice cream at Bố Già!\nMar 2025 • Friends\nSuch a cool place that we stumbled upon after visiting the majestic Vĩnh Nghiêm pagoda! The friendly server suggested wonderful ice cream selections on the big menu. Delicious, tasty, and very affordable! We especially loved the passionfruit pastry topped with chocolate ice cream. A sweet, beautiful lady (may be the owner?) told us about the fascinating history of the shop. We enjoyed looking at old b/w photos inside the shop. This is a great local place to chill and eat ice cream! Highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten March 6, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
