            "review_title": "Review at Bo Gia Ice Cream - Coffee - Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Kijtanat P\nBangkok, Thailand176 contributions\n0\nBest Ice Cream & Western Foods in Saigon\nJan 2018 • Family\nBy chance we came across this restaurant which is a legendary. It’s original location was in the center of the city but recently was relocated due to infrastructure projects inside the city.\n\nThe new location is close to the airport and it’s nice to drop by for a quick meal or ice cream from the airport going into the city.\n\nWe had coconut ice cream and their signature pizza (bo Gia pizza). The toppings include prawn, bacon, tuna, mozzarella cheese, pineapple and onion.\n\nThe price is also very reasonable considering the quality of the ingredients, the taste and hygiene.\n\nThis restaurant is most well known to locals as it was opened since 1975.\nRead more\nWritten January 2, 2018",
